<%# RAILS_FEATURES.md #104: Turbo Frame server-side markup. Hand-rolled
    <turbo-frame> wrappers (the app ships no JS and no turbo-rails gem) —
    this audits the server-rendered frame HTML: an eager frame wrapping a
    partial collection, and a lazy frame with a src attribute. %>
<turbo-frame id="posts-frame">
  <%= render partial: "posts/post", collection: @posts %>
</turbo-frame>
<turbo-frame id="posts-lazy" src="/stats"></turbo-frame>
